/* ===========================================================================
   SECTION 12: TEXT PARSING ENGINE (EXTRACTING DATA FROM THE BACKGROUND TEXT)
   Goal: Auditors write a lot of important information (like names, countries, 
   and standards) in a single large text box called "Background". 
   This robot reads that text and extracts each piece of information into 
